      "claim": "Alprazolam gets into breast milk. While it is possible to breastfeed while taking alprazolam, a different medication might be preferred. If you suspect the baby has any symptoms (being too sleepy, poor feeding, and poor weight gain), contact the child’s healthcare provider. After a single dose of alprazolam, there is usually no need to wait to breastfeed.",
